{
  "answer": "You can configure trusted hosts using the `TrustHosts` parameter in the `FastAPI` constructor. For HTTPS redirection, you can use the `HTTPRedirectMiddleware` from the `fastapi.middleware.http` module. \n\nExample:\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, HTTPRedirectMiddleware\nfrom fastapi.middleware.http import HTTPRedirectMiddleware\n\napp = FastAPI(trust_host_header=True)\napp.add_middleware(HTTPRedirectMiddleware, redirect_status_code=301)\n```",
